{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20308",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.04,
      "end_seconds": 7.41,
      "duration_seconds": 6.37,
      "text": "Doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.9,
      "end_seconds": 13.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "Yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.11,
      "end_seconds": 23.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.91,
      "text": "mainly pain in my right shoulder there's a couple of other things, but that's the main one"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.99,
      "end_seconds": 27.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Alright, what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.19,
      "end_seconds": 32.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "for six months, I'd say"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.85,
      "end_seconds": 42.01,
      "duration_seconds": 8.16,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.99,
      "end_seconds": 67.98,
      "duration_seconds": 23.99,
      "text": "It's worse with lifting my arm and reaching overhead. It happens a couple of times a week. Pretty severe, if I'm being honest. I've also had pain at night when I lie on it, for about a month. And there's a clicking in the shoulder as well, six months now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.54,
      "end_seconds": 75.09,
      "duration_seconds": 6.55,
      "text": "Have you had pain in your right shoulder before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.12,
      "end_seconds": 82.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "A bit, last year. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.54,
      "end_seconds": 88.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.79,
      "end_seconds": 98.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.08,
      "end_seconds": 121.45,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 126 over 68, saturation 98 percent, temperature is 36.9 degrees, pulse 75."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.3,
      "end_seconds": 128.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.23,
      "end_seconds": 130.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.18,
      "end_seconds": 158.33,
      "duration_seconds": 12.15,
      "text": "There is pain when you lift the arm out to the side between about sixty and one hundred and twenty degrees, and the grip strength is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.96,
      "end_seconds": 164.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "That's the examination finished."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.91,
      "end_seconds": 183.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "And what about fall or injury or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.69,
      "end_seconds": 191.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.46,
      "end_seconds": 197.56,
      "duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. A few quick ones: chest pain, swelling or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.83,
      "end_seconds": 200.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.25,
      "end_seconds": 204.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "How's your breathing otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.19,
      "end_seconds": 209.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.87,
      "end_seconds": 215.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "alright, on the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.71,
      "end_seconds": 219.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.16,
      "end_seconds": 222.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.33,
      "end_seconds": 228.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Metoprolol, 50 milligrams, maybe, twice a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.21,
      "end_seconds": 234.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Did you happen to bring the box or the paperwork?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.99,
      "end_seconds": 241.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "No, it's at home. I'm on diclofenac gel, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.24,
      "end_seconds": 246.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.35,
      "end_seconds": 249.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "About two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.49,
      "end_seconds": 253.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.61,
      "end_seconds": 257.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.87,
      "end_seconds": 264.04,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "yes are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.6,
      "end_seconds": 267.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "not to my knowledge, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.97,
      "end_seconds": 282.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.27,
      "end_seconds": 287.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.88,
      "end_seconds": 292.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.36,
      "end_seconds": 298.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.32,
      "end_seconds": 305.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.5,
      "end_seconds": 310.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.85,
      "end_seconds": 351.28,
      "duration_seconds": 33.43,
      "text": "I want a shoulder X-ray done, that's for shoulder pain. An ultrasound of the shoulder is what I'd like next, for shoulder pain. Keep the shoulder moving gently within comfort and avoid heavy overhead lifting. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. Keep an eye out, and if the arm becomes numb or you get fever, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.04,
      "end_seconds": 355.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "I know what to watch for"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 356.29,
      "end_seconds": 359.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 361.37,
      "end_seconds": 364.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 366.66,
      "end_seconds": 367.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "look after yourself"
    }
  ]
}